{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Algebra generated by transfer matrices at $\\theta_1 + r h$\n\ngl(3), L=2, adjoint ⊗ adjoint (dim 64). Generators: $\\mathbb 1$, $t_{\\{1,0\\}}(\\theta_1+rh)$, $t_{\\{1,1\\}}(\\theta_1+rh)$ for $r$ in some set $S\\subset\\{-3,\\dots,3\\}$. Question: dimension of the (commutative) algebra they generate, as a function of $S$.\n\nConventions as in `L2-localization-tests.wb`: $L_{ij}(u)=u\\delta_{ij}-hE_{ji}$, $T=L_1(u-\\theta_1)L_2(u-\\theta_2)G$, site 1 left; $t_{\\{1,0\\}}$ = trace, $t_{\\{1,1\\}}$ = sum of principal 2×2 quantum minors. Point 1: $h=1/3$, $\\theta=(2/7,-5/11)$, $G=\\mathrm{diag}(2,-3,5)$.\n\n**Method.** If a generic combination of *all* generators has 64 distinct eigenvalues, the full family is simultaneously diagonalizable, so for any subset $S$ the algebra is spanned by the joint spectral projectors and $\\dim = $ number of distinct joint eigenvalue tuples $=$ degree of the minimal polynomial of a generic combination of that subset. That degree is computed exactly as a Krylov rank modulo a large prime (checked with two primes).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ps[rep_] :=\n  ps[rep] = \n   Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #] & /@ (Tuples[\n          Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, \n            Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]))}, \n    If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse@Sort@res, \n     Reverse@Sort@Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := \n  J0[k][pat] = \n   Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := \n  Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[\n     Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, \n         Range[k + 1]}]/\n       Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, \n         Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[\n       ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := \n  Jm[k][pat] = \n   Sum[Product[\n       pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/\n      Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, \n        Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[\n      ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := \n  JJ[k, l, rep] = \n   Which[k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]], l == k + 1, \n    Transpose[\n     Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ \n       ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l == k - 1, \n    Transpose[\n     Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ \n       ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l > k + 1, \n    JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - \n     JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep], l < k - 1, \n    JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - \n     JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* prefixed names (a...) so this does not clobber the shared-kernel symbols of L2-localization-tests.wb; the GT cell above is identical there *)\nClearAll[aE, aL, aT, aQM, at];\naRep = {2, 1, 0}; aD = dim[aRep];\nah = 1/3; ath = {2/7, -5/11}; aG = DiagonalMatrix[{2, -3, 5}];\naE[i_, j_] := aE[i, j] = JJ[i, j, aRep];\naL[i_, j_][u_] := u IdentityMatrix[aD] KroneckerDelta[i, j] - ah aE[j, i];\n(* twisted monodromy T(u).G, site 1 = left tensor factor *)\naT[{i_, j_}][u_] := aT[{i, j}][u] = Sum[KroneckerProduct[aL[i, k][u - ath[[1]]], aL[k, l][u - ath[[2]]]] aG[[l, j]], {k, 3}, {l, 3}];\n(* quantum minor, same shift convention as QMG in L2-localization-tests.wb *)\naQM[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := aQM[Ii, Jj][u] = Sum[Signature[Permutations[Ii][[s]]] (Dot @@ (aT[#][u + ah - ah Last[Flatten[Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[s]], Jj}], #]]]] & /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[s]], Jj}])), {s, 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\nat[{1, 0}][u_] := at[{1, 0}][u] = Sum[aT[{i, i}][u], {i, 3}];\nat[{1, 1}][u_] := at[{1, 1}][u] = Sum[aQM[Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {2}]}];\n(* the 14 generators at theta1 + r h *)\naGen = Association@Flatten@Table[{\"t10\", r} -> at[{1, 0}][ath[[1]] + r ah], {r, -3, 3}];\naGen = Join[aGen, Association@Flatten@Table[{\"t11\", r} -> at[{1, 1}][ath[[1]] + r ah], {r, -3, 3}]];\n(* sanity: all 14 commute *)\n{aD^2, And @@ Flatten@Outer[#1 . #2 == #2 . #1 &, Values[aGen], Values[aGen], 1]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"1\" data-out-n=\"30\" data-sub-idx=\"16\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"2\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"16\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[30]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRcezY0LFxtYXRocm17VHJ1ZX1ccmlnaHRcfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[30]= \\left\\{64,\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "7b8b6be0-2deb-4503-b5a3-8b16c9051bc6"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* exact count mod a large prime: dim of the algebra generated by {1, gens} = degree of the minimal polynomial of a generic combination\n   (valid because the full family has simple spectrum, checked in the first row); minpoly degree = Krylov rank for a generic vector *)\naPrimes = {2147483647, 1000000007};\ntoModP[m_, p_] := Mod[Numerator[m] PowerMod[Denominator[m], -1, p], p];\naGenP = Association@Table[p -> Map[toModP[#, p] &, aGen], {p, aPrimes}];\nalgDim[keys_List, p_] := Module[{X, v},\n   If[keys === {}, Return[1]];\n   SeedRandom[Hash[{keys, p}]];\n   X = Mod[Sum[RandomInteger[{1, p - 1}] aGenP[p][k], {k, keys}], p];\n   v = RandomInteger[{1, p - 1}, 64];\n   MatrixRank[NestList[Mod[X . #, p] &, v, 64], Modulus -> p]];\nalgDim2[keys_List] := With[{d = algDim[keys, #] & /@ aPrimes}, If[Equal @@ d, First[d], d]];\n(* linear span of {1, gens} (as vectors), to separate 'linear' from 'polynomial' information *)\nlinDim[keys_List] := MatrixRank[Prepend[Flatten /@ Lookup[aGenP[First@aPrimes], keys], Flatten@IdentityMatrix[64]], Modulus -> First@aPrimes];\nkeysOf[types_, rs_] := Flatten[Table[{ty, r}, {ty, types}, {r, rs}], 1];\n{\"full family (all 14)\", algDim2[Keys[aGen]], \"linear span\", linDim[Keys[aGen]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"2\" data-out-n=\"38\" data-sub-idx=\"9\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"15\" data-sub-end=\"15\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[38]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRce1x0ZXh0e2Z1bGwgZmFtaWx5IChhbGwgMTQpfSw2NCxcdGV4dHtsaW5lYXIgc3Bhbn0sN1xyaWdodFx9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">full family (all 14)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">linear span</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
