  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* diagonal twist conserves weight: the GT basis is a Cartan eigenbasis, so the t's are block-diagonal by weight. Per-weight-sector count, t10 alone vs everything *)\naWt = Transpose[Table[Diagonal[KroneckerProduct[aE[i, i], IdentityMatrix[aD]] + KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[aD], aE[i, i]]], {i, 3}]];\naSectors = GatherBy[Range[64], aWt[[#]] &];\nsecDim[keys_, idx_, p_] := Module[{X, v}, SeedRandom[Hash[{keys, idx, p}]];\n   X = Mod[Sum[RandomInteger[{1, p - 1}] aGenP[p][k][[idx, idx]], {k, keys}], p]; v = RandomInteger[{1, p - 1}, Length[idx]];\n   MatrixRank[NestList[Mod[X . #, p] &, v, Length[idx]], Modulus -> p]];\naSecTab = Table[{aWt[[First@idx]], Length[idx], secDim[keysOf[{\"t10\"}, Range[-3, 3]], idx, First@aPrimes], secDim[keysOf[{\"t11\"}, {0}], idx, First@aPrimes], secDim[keysOf[{\"t11\"}, {3}], idx, First@aPrimes], secDim[Keys[aGen], idx, First@aPrimes]}, {idx, aSectors}];\nGrid[Prepend[Select[aSecTab, #[[2]] > 1 &], {\"weight\", \"sector dim\", \"t10 (all r)\", \"t11(th1)\", \"t11(th1+3h)\", \"all\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
