  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Untwisted chain ($G=\\mathbb 1$)\n\nNow the t's commute with gl(3), so the algebra lives on multiplicity spaces of $8\\otimes 8 = 27\\oplus10\\oplus\\overline{10}\\oplus 8\\oplus 8\\oplus 1$; the maximum possible commutative dimension is $1+1+1+2+1=6$ (the two octets span a 2-dim multiplicity space). Simple spectrum fails here, so the dimension is computed by explicit closure: span of all products of generators, mod $p$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[bT, bQM, bt];\nbT[{i_, j_}][u_] := bT[{i, j}][u] = Sum[KroneckerProduct[aL[i, k][u - ath[[1]]], aL[k, j][u - ath[[2]]]], {k, 3}];\nbQM[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := bQM[Ii, Jj][u] = Sum[Signature[Permutations[Ii][[s]]] (Dot @@ (bT[#][u + ah - ah Last[Flatten[Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[s]], Jj}], #]]]] & /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[s]], Jj}])), {s, 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\nbt[{1, 0}][u_] := bt[{1, 0}][u] = Sum[bT[{i, i}][u], {i, 3}];\nbt[{1, 1}][u_] := bt[{1, 1}][u] = Sum[bQM[Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {2}]}];\nbGen = Join[Association@Table[{\"t10\", r} -> bt[{1, 0}][ath[[1]] + r ah], {r, -3, 3}], Association@Table[{\"t11\", r} -> bt[{1, 1}][ath[[1]] + r ah], {r, -3, 3}]];\nbGenP = Map[toModP[#, First@aPrimes] &, bGen];\n(* algebra closure: BFS over products, keep a row-reduced basis of flattened matrices mod p *)\nclosureDim[keys_List, p_] := Module[{gens = Lookup[bGenP, keys], basis = {IdentityMatrix[64]}, rows = {Flatten@IdentityMatrix[64]}, frontier, new, m},\n   frontier = basis;\n   While[frontier =!= {}, new = {};\n    Do[m = Mod[b . g, p]; If[MatrixRank[Append[rows, Flatten[m]], Modulus -> p] > Length[rows], AppendTo[rows, Flatten[m]]; AppendTo[new, m]], {b, frontier}, {g, gens}];\n    frontier = new];\n   Length[rows]];\n{\"commute with gl(3)\", And @@ Flatten@Table[g . (KroneckerProduct[aE[i, j], IdentityMatrix[aD]] + KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[aD], aE[i, j]]) == (KroneckerProduct[aE[i, j], IdentityMatrix[aD]] + KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[aD], aE[i, j]]) . g, {g, Values[bGen][[{1, 8}]]}, {i, 3}, {j, 3}]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"6\" data-out-n=\"57\" data-sub-idx=\"9\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"8\" data-sub-start=\"14\" data-sub-end=\"14\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[57]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRce1x0ZXh0e2NvbW11dGUgd2l0aCBnbCgzKX0sXG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfVxyaWdodFx9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">commute with gl(3)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[57]= \\left\\{\\text{commute with gl(3)},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
