  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* eigenvalues on highest-weight vectors of each irrep in 8x8 (the octet space is 2-dim, so it gives 2 eigenvalues) *)\nEEt[i_, j_] := KroneckerProduct[aE[i, j], IdentityMatrix[aD]] + KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[aD], aE[i, j]];\n(* rows of hwSpace[w] = basis of the (op-invariant) hw space of weight w *)\nhwSpace[w_] := Module[{idx = Flatten@Position[aWt, w], ns},\n   ns = NullSpace[Join[EEt[1, 2][[All, idx]], EEt[2, 3][[All, idx]]]];\n   Table[ReplacePart[ConstantArray[0, 64], Thread[idx -> n]], {n, ns}]];\nhwEig[op_, w_] := Module[{B = hwSpace[w]}, Sort@Eigenvalues[LinearSolve[B . Transpose[B], B . op . Transpose[B]]]];\nirr = {{4, 2, 0}, {3, 3, 0}, {4, 1, 1}, {3, 2, 1}, {2, 2, 2}};\nhwTab = Table[Join[{r}, Table[hwEig[bt[{1, 1}][ath[[1]] + r ah], w], {w, irr}]], {r, {0, 1, 3}}];\nGrid[Prepend[hwTab, Prepend[irr, \"t11 at r\"]], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
