  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* point-2 check of the three structured localized monomials, plus the non-localized t11(th1)^2 as control.\n   compTowers builds companion-frame t10, t11 at any point (non-memoized); validated against ct at point 1 first *)\ncompTowers[h_, th_, zz_] := Module[{chi, Gm, L, TT, QM},\n   chi = {Total[zz], -(zz[[1]] zz[[2]] + zz[[1]] zz[[3]] + zz[[2]] zz[[3]]), Times @@ zz};\n   Gm = {chi, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\n   L[i_, j_][u_] := u IdentityMatrix[aD] KroneckerDelta[i, j] - h aE[j, i];\n   TT[{i_, j_}][u_] := Sum[KroneckerProduct[L[i, k][u - th[[1]]], L[k, l][u - th[[2]]]] Gm[[l, j]], {k, 3}, {l, 3}];\n   (* same shift convention as cQM: T_aa(u) T_bb(u-h) - T_ba(u) T_ab(u-h) *)\n   QM[{a_, b_}][u_] := TT[{a, a}][u] . TT[{b, b}][u - h] - TT[{b, a}][u] . TT[{a, b}][u - h];\n   {Function[u, Sum[TT[{i, i}][u], {i, 3}]], Function[u, Sum[QM[p][u], {p, Subsets[Range[3], {2}]}]]}];\nisLoc[w_] := MatrixRank[ArrayReshape[w, {8, 8}][[All, 1 ;; 7]]] == 0;\npt2Check = Module[{p1 = compTowers[ah, ath, {2, -3, 5}], p2 = compTowers[1/2, {3/13, -4/17}, {3, -7/2, 11/4}], t10, t11, th1 = 3/13, h = 1/2},\n   {t10, t11} = p2;\n   {\"builder = ct at point 1\", p1[[1]][1/7] == ct[{1, 0}][1/7] && p1[[2]][1/7] == ct[{1, 1}][1/7],\n    \"<0|t11(th1) localized\", isLoc[vac0 . t11[th1]],\n    \"<0|t10(th1+h)t11(th1) localized\", isLoc[vac0 . t11[th1] . t10[th1 + h]],\n    \"<0|t11(th1)^2 localized (control)\", isLoc[vac0 . t11[th1] . t11[th1]]}];\npt2Check",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"15\" data-out-n=\"101\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"17\" data-sub-start=\"17\" data-sub-end=\"17\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[101]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">builder = ct at point 1</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;0|t11(th1) localized</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;0|t10(th1+h)t11(th1) localized</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;0|t11(th1)</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2 localized (control)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[101]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{builder = ct at point 1},\\mathrm{True} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{<0|t11(th1) localized},\\mathrm{True} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{<0|t10(th1+h)t11(th1) localized},\\mathrm{True} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{<0|t11(th1)\\^{}2 localized (control)},\\mathrm{False}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
