  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* reweighted L1 (Candes-Wakin-Boyd): weights 1/(|c|+eps), several rounds; report support size each round, exact check on the final one *)\nrwL1[rounds_, eps_] := Module[{w = ConstantArray[1., nm], c, s, sizes = {}},\n   Do[c = Module[{sol = LinearProgramming[Join[w, w], N[Join[Aeq, -Aeq, 2]], Transpose[{N[beq], ConstantArray[0, Length[beq]]}], Method -> \"Simplex\"]}, sol[[;; nm]] - sol[[nm + 1 ;;]]];\n    s = Flatten@Position[Abs[c], x_ /; x > 10^-8]; AppendTo[sizes, Length[s]];\n    w = 1./(Abs[c] + eps), {rounds}];\n   {sizes, s}];\n{rwSizes, rwSupp} = rwL1[8, 10^-3];\n{\"support sizes by round\", rwSizes, \"exact on final support\", With[{ce = exactOnSupp[rwSupp]}, ce =!= $Failed && Transpose[Wall[[rwSupp, Join[nonV1, {8}]]]] . ce == beq], \"degree histogram of support\", Tally[Length /@ mons[[rwSupp]]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"23\" data-out-n=\"150\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"24\" data-sub-start=\"7\" data-sub-end=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[150]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9.6001em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.36em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.55em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" st