  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings (2026-09-29, point 1): yes, it's a mess\n\n- **Row 8 is exactly the singlet direction.** $\\langle0|Y_8=c\\,e_1^T\\otimes e_8^T$, with a pure $e_1$ site-1 factor.\n- **The polynomial is $Y_8$.** The degree-4 polynomial in $\\{t_{10}(\\theta_1),t_{10}(\\theta_1+h),t_{11}(\\theta_1+rh)_{r=0..3}\\}$ reproducing $\\langle0|Y_8$ equals $Y_8$ exactly as a 64×64 operator. So its eigenvalues are the known Q-form $C\\,\\frac{Q_1(\\theta_1+2h)}{Q_1(\\theta_1+h)}\\frac{D_1(0,2)+\\frac{\\rho_2}{T-1}D_1(0,1)}{D_1(-1,0)}$. Nothing new is gained.\n- **As a polynomial it is dense.**\n  - On a greedy 64-monomial basis: 59 nonzero coefficients, up to 44-digit numerators. Generator entries have ≤7 digits.\n  - Sparsest search over all 210 monomials of degree ≤4, adding any of the 7 other localized directions freely: L1 and 8 rounds of reweighted L1 both stall at **55 monomials**. There are 57 constraints, so this is essentially maximal density.\n  - Degree profile of that support: 2/7/13/33 monomials at degree 1/2/3/4. Exact coefficients on it are consistent, with up to ~216 digits (unnormalized monomials).\n- **Why.** A polynomial rep of $Y_8$ in the $t(\\theta_1+rh)$ is an interpolation of its eigenvalue over the 64-point spectrum. The inverses $t_{10}^{-1}(\\theta_1)$ and $t_{10}^{-1}(\\theta_2)$ inside $R$ are what make $Y_8$ compact. Without them (and without the $\\theta_2$ point) the compact form is lost.\n- **Caveat.** L1 is a heuristic, so this is not a proof that no sparse representation exists. The stall at 55 under reweighting is strong evidence, though.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# $(e_1\\otimes e_8)^T$ in the two-site SoV basis\n\nSoV basis (companion frame), rebuilt here: $\\langle x_{g_1|g_2}|=\\langle0|O_{g_1}(\\theta_1)O_{g_2}(\\theta_2)$ with $\\langle0|=e_8^T\\otimes e_8^T$.\n- $O_{100}=1$, $O_{110}=t_{10}$, $O_{111}=t_{11}$, $O_{200}=R$, $O_{210}=t_{20}$.\n- $O_{211}=Rt_{11}$, $O_{220}=Rt_{20}$, $O_{221}=Rt_{21}$.\n\nHere $R=t_{20}t_{10}^{-1}$. We check that these are left eigenvectors of $B(u)=T_{11}(u)\\,QM_{12,12}(u+h)+T_{21}(u)\\,QM_{12,13}(u+h)$ (untwisted $T$), then expand $e_1^T\\otimes e_8^T$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "sovLabels = {\"100\", \"110\", \"111\", \"200\", \"210\", \"211\", \"220\", \"221\"};\nsovOp[u_] := sovOp[u] = Module[{R = cR[u]}, AssociationThread[sovLabels -> {IdentityMatrix[64], ct[{1, 0}][u], ct[{1, 1}][u], R, ct20[u], R . ct[{1, 1}][u], R . ct20[u], R . ct21[u]}]];\nsovStates = Association@Flatten@Table[{g1, g2} -> vac0 . sovOp[ath[[1]]][g1] . sovOp[ath[[2]]][g2], {g1, sovLabels}, {g2, sovLabels}];\nsovMat = Values[sovStates];\n(* B operator from the untwisted monodromy bT *)\nBop[u_] := bT[{1, 1}][u] . bQM[{1, 2}, {1, 2}][u + ah] + bT[{2, 1}][u] . bQM[{1, 2}, {1, 3}][u + ah];\nB1 = Bop[1/5]; B2 = Bop[-2/9];\n(* left eigenvector test: rank{x, x.B} == 1 for each state *)\n{\"rank of 64 SoV states\", MatrixRank[sovMat], \"[B(u),B(v)]=0\", B1 . B2 == B2 . B1, \"all left B-eigenvectors\", And @@ (MatrixRank[{#, # . B1}] == 1 && MatrixRank[{#, # . B2}] == 1 & /@ sovMat)}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"24\" data-out-n=\"157\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"27\" data-sub-start=\"8\" data-sub-end=\"8\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[157]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FsaWduZWR9CiAgJlxsZWZ0XHtcdGV4dHtyYW5rIG9mIDY0IFNvViBzdGF0ZXN9LDY0LFx0ZXh0e1tCKHUpLEIodildPTB9LFxtYXRocm17VHJ1ZX0gXHJpZ2h0LiBcXAogICZcbGVmdC4gLFx0ZXh0e2FsbCBsZWZ0IEItZWlnZW52ZWN0b3JzfSxcbWF0aHJte1RydWV9XHJpZ2h0XH0KXGVuZHthbGlnbmVkfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank of 64 SoV states</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">[B(u),B(v)]=0</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">all left B-eigenvectors</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[157]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{rank of 64 SoV states},64,\\text{[B(u),B(v)]=0},\\mathrm{True} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{all left B-eigenvectors},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "33124949-396f-4b41-b0ae-aea4541dd436"
