  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* expand e1^T (x) e8^T (index 8) in the SoV basis; keep nonzero coefficients, normalised to the first one *)\ne1e8 = UnitVector[64, 8];\nsovCoef = AssociationThread[Keys[sovStates] -> LinearSolve[Transpose[sovMat], e1e8]];\nsovNZ = Select[sovCoef, # != 0 &];\n{\"# terms\", Length[sovNZ], \"labels\", Keys[sovNZ], \"ratios to first\", Values[sovNZ]/First[Values[sovNZ]], \"compare -1/(T+1)\", -1/(TT + 1)}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
