      {
       "data": "Out[163]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{point 1 (rebuilt)} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\left\\{\\begin{pmatrix}\\text{211} & \\text{200}\\\\\\text{221} & \\text{100}\\end{pmatrix},\\left\\{-\\frac{77}{248},1\\right\\},-\\frac{77}{248}\\right\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{point 2} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\left\\{\\begin{pmatrix}\\text{211} & \\text{200}\\\\\\text{221} & \\text{100}\\end{pmatrix},\\left\\{-\\frac{221}{427},1\\right\\},-\\frac{221}{427}\\right\\}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "7e950e73-2fae-4fb4-9e8d-66ee7a652275"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings (2026-09-29): two terms\n\nThe 64 recipe states are independent and are left $B(u)$-eigenvectors ($[B(u),B(v)]=0$ checked). In that basis, exactly, at points 1 and 2:\n$$e_1^T\\otimes e_8^T\\;\\propto\\;\\langle x_{221|100}|-\\frac{1}{T+1}\\,\\langle x_{211|200}|,\\qquad T=\\frac{\\theta_1-\\theta_2}{h},$$\ni.e. $\\langle0|\\big[R\\,t_{21}(\\theta_1)-\\tfrac1{T+1}R\\,t_{11}(\\theta_1)\\,R(\\theta_2)\\big]$. All other 62 coefficients vanish. Coefficient values: point 1, $-77/248$; point 2, $-221/427$. This is row 8 of the site-1 table in `main-notes.tex`, rederived here by direct expansion. The site-2 content is just $1$ or $R(\\theta_2)$, the two lowest SoV states on site 2 (root sets $\\{-1,0,1\\}$, $\\{-1,0,2\\}$).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Contour form of the $e_1\\otimes e_8$ functional: SoV normalisations vs a measure\n\nFirst the Q's, ported from `L2-localization-tests.wb` cells 40–41 and 56. The $\\tau_a(u)$ are frame-independent, so we diagonalise the companion-frame family directly. The Baxter operator `baxDir` gives $Q_i=z_i^{u/h}q_i$, monic, $\\deg q_i=4-\\mu_i$.\n\nThen, for each recipe state $x$, the state-independent constant $n_x=\\dfrac{\\langle x|\\Psi\\rangle/\\langle x_{100|100}|\\Psi\\rangle}{\\Phi(x)/\\Phi(100|100)}$. Here $\\Phi$ is the Ryan–Volin wave function, $\\Phi=\\prod_sQ_1(\\theta_s+r_3h)D_s(r_1,r_2)$. So $n_x$ is the normalisation of the raw recipe state relative to RV.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "mprec = 60;\nmnu[n_][x_] := Product[x - ath[[s]] - ah aRep[[n]], {s, 2}];\n(* Baxter operator, copied from L2-localization-tests.wb cell 41 (hh -> ah, nu -> mnu) *)\nmBaxDir[{t1_, t2_, t3_}, zz_][q_][x_] := zz mnu[1][x] mnu[1][x - ah] mnu[1][x - 2 ah] q[x + ah] - (t1 /. u -> x) mnu[1][x - ah] mnu[1][x - 2 ah] q[x] + (t2 /. u -> x) mnu[1][x - 2 ah] q[x - ah]/zz - (t3 /. u -> x) q[x - 2 ah]/zz^2;\nmSolveMonic[op_, degree_] := Module[{c, x, q, eqs, aa, bb, sol, res},\n   q = Function[y, Evaluate[y^degree + Sum[c[m] y^m, {m, 0, degree - 1}]]];\n   eqs = CoefficientList[Expand[op[q][x]], x];\n   aa = Table[Coefficient[e, c[m]], {e, eqs}, {m, 0, degree - 1}]; bb = eqs /. c[_] -> 0;\n   sol = If[degree == 0, {}, LeastSquares[aa, -bb]];\n   res = If[degree == 0, bb, aa . sol + bb];\n   {Function[y, Evaluate[q[y] /. Thread[Table[c[m], {m, 0, degree - 1}] -> sol]]], Max[Abs[res]]/Max[Join[{1}, Abs@Flatten[{aa, bb}]]]}];\n(* companion-frame joint eigenbasis (right eigenvectors) *)\nmMix = N[ct[{1, 0}][1/13] + 3 ct[{1, 1}][-2/9], mprec];\n{mEvals, mEvecs} = Eigensystem[mMix];\nmTau[a_][x_] := Switch[a, 1, ct[{1, 0}][x], 2, ct[{1, 1}][x], 3, ct3[x]];\nmKK = First@Ordering[Abs[#], -1] & /@ mEvecs;\nmTauEig[a_, x_] := With[{M = N[mTau[a][x], mprec]}, Table[(M . mEvecs[[A]])[[mKK[[A]]]]/mEvecs[[A, mKK[[A]]]], {A, 64}]];\nmUpts = Range[0, 6]/7 + 1/11;\nmTauPts = Table[mTauEig[a, x], {a, 3}, {x, mUpts}];\nmTauPoly = Table[Expand@InterpolatingPolynomial[Transpose[{mUpts, mTauPts[[a, All, A]]}], u], {A, 64}, {a, 3}];\n(* companion twist does not conserve weight: read mu_i off tau1's u^1 coefficient is not possible, so scan degrees: the unique monic degree with a solution *)\nmzs = {2, -3, 5};\nmQfit[A_, i_] := First@SortBy[Table[Prepend[mSolveMonic[mBaxDir[mTauPoly[[A]], N[mzs[[i]], mprec]], d], d], {d, 0, 6}], #[[3]] &];\nmQ = Table[mQfit[A, i], {A, 64}, {i, 2}];\n{\"max Baxter residual\", N[Max[mQ[[All, All, 3]]], 3], \"degree tally (q1, q2)\", Tally[mQ[[All, All, 1]]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"27\" data-out-n=\"179\" data-sub-idx=\"18\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"32\" data-sub-start=\"24\" data-sub-end=\"24\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[179]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:26.1243em;vertical-align:-12.8122em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:13.3122em;\"><span style=\"top:-26.1222em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-24.5981em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:12.8122em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:13.3122em;\"><span style=\"top:-26.1222em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max Baxter resid