  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* does n_x factorise over sites? rank of the 8x8 table n[g1, g2] *)\nnTab = Table[nx[{g1, g2}], {g1, sovLabels}, {g2, sovLabels}];\nnRank = MatrixRank[nTab];\nsiteA = nTab[[All, 1]]/nTab[[1, 1]]; siteB = nTab[[1, All]]/nTab[[1, 1]];\n(* theta12 +- k h in units that expose prime factors: theta12 = 57/77, h = 1/3 at point 1; list (T + k) for k = -3..3 *)\nTT1 = (ath[[1]] - ath[[2]])/ah;\n{\"rank of n table\", nRank, \"T\", TT1, \"T+k, k=-3..3\", Table[TT1 + k, {k, -3, 3}]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
