  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* full pipeline at a given point: towers, SoV states, Baxter Q's, n_x, rotation expansion. Resets the globals ah, ath, cG, mzs and all memoized companion-frame symbols; the kernel is left at that point *)\nrunPoint[{h_, th_, zz_}] := Module[{chi},\n   ah = h; ath = th; mzs = zz;\n   chi = {Total[zz], -(zz[[1]] zz[[2]] + zz[[1]] zz[[3]] + zz[[2]] zz[[3]]), Times @@ zz};\n   cG = {chi, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\n   ClearAll[cT, cQM, ct, sovOp];\n   cT[{i_, j_}][u_] := cT[{i, j}][u] = Sum[KroneckerProduct[aL[i, k][u - ath[[1]]], aL[k, l][u - ath[[2]]]] cG[[l, j]], {k, 3}, {l, 3}];\n   cQM[Ii_, Jj_][u_] := cQM[Ii, Jj][u] = Sum[Signature[Permutations[Ii][[s]]] (Dot @@ (cT[#][u + ah - ah Last[Flatten[Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[s]], Jj}], #]]]] & /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii][[s]], Jj}])), {s, 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}];\n   ct[{1, 0}][u_] := ct[{1, 0}][u] = Sum[cT[{i, i}][u], {i, 3}];\n   ct[{1, 1}][u_] := ct[{1, 1}][u] = Sum[cQM[Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {2}]}];\n   sovOp[u_] := sovOp[u] = Module[{R = cR[u]}, AssociationThread[sovLabels -> {IdentityMatrix[64], ct[{1, 0}][u], ct[{1, 1}][u], R, ct20[u], R . ct[{1, 1}][u], R . ct20[u], R . ct21[u]}]];\n   sovStates = Association@Flatten@Table[{g1, g2} -> vac0 . sovOp[ath[[1]]][g1] . sovOp[ath[[2]]][g2], {g1, sovLabels}, {g2, sovLabels}];\n   sovMat = Values[sovStates];\n   (* spectrum and Q's *)\n   mMix = N[ct[{1, 0}][1/13] + 3 ct[{1, 1}][-2/9], mprec];\n   {mEvals, mEvecs} = Eigensystem[mMix];\n   mKK = First@Ordering[Abs[#], -1] & /@ mEvecs;\n   mTauPts = Table[mTauEig[a, x], {a, 3}, {x, mUpts}];\n   mTauPoly = Table[Expand@InterpolatingPolynomial[Transpose[{mUpts, mTauPts[[a, All, A]]}], u], {A, 64}, {a, 3}];\n   mQ = Table[mQfit[A, i], {A, 64}, {i, 2}];\n   (* n_x *)\n   mOv = Table[N[sovStates[k], mprec] . mEvecs[[A]], {A, 64}, {k, Keys[sovStates]}];\n   nRaw = Table[(mOv[[A, k]]/mOv[[A, refK]])/(mPhi[A, Keys[sovStates][[k]]]/mPhi[A, {\"100\", \"100\"}]), {A, 64}, {k, 64}];\n   spreadN = Table[With[{c = nRaw[[All, k]]}, Max[Abs[c - Mean[c]]]/Abs[Mean[c]]], {k, 64}];\n   nx = AssociationThread[Keys[sovStates] -> Rationalize[Chop[Mean /@ Transpose[nRaw], 10^-40], 10^-35]];\n   (* rotation expansion *)\n   sovInv = Inverse[sovMat];\n   cW = AssociationThread[Keys[sovStates] -> Expand[wr . sovInv]];\n   cWnz = Select[cW, # =!= 0 &];\n   cRV = Association@KeyValueMap[#1 -> Factor[#2 nx[#1]/(cW[{\"100\", \"100\"}] nx[{\"100\", \"100\"}])] &, cWnz];\n   {\"Baxter residual\", N[Max[mQ[[All, All, 3]]], 3], \"n_x spread\", N[Max[spreadN], 3], \"# terms\", Length[cWnz], \"T\", (ath[[1]] - ath[[2]])/ah}];\ncRV1 = cRV; nx1 = nx;\npt2Run = runPoint[{1/2, {3/13, -4/17}, {3, -7/2, 11/4}}];\ncRV2 = cRV; nx2 = nx;\npt2Run",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
