  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* formulas read off at point 1 (in T only); ratio actual/guess at both points exposes hidden powers of h *)\nguessRV[T_] := <|{\"100\", \"100\"} -> 1, {\"100\", \"200\"} -> (T + 1)/(T (T - 1)) r1, {\"110\", \"100\"} -> 2 (T - 2)/(T - 1) r1,\n   {\"111\", \"100\"} -> -3 (T - 2)/(T - 1) (r2 - r1 r3), {\"200\", \"100\"} -> r3 - (T - 1)/T r1, {\"200\", \"200\"} -> (r2 + r1 r3)/(T - 1),\n   {\"210\", \"100\"} -> (T - 2)/(T - 1) (r2 + r1 r3), {\"210\", \"200\"} -> 2/T r1 r2,\n   {\"211\", \"100\"} -> 2 ((T - 3) r1 r2 - (T - 2) r3 (r2 - r1 r3))/(T - 1), {\"211\", \"200\"} -> -2 (T - 2)/(T (T - 1)) r2 (r2 - r1 r3),\n   {\"220\", \"100\"} -> (T - 2)/T r1 r2, {\"221\", \"100\"} -> -2 (T - 2)/T r2 (r2 - r1 r3)|>;\nT1 = 171/77; T2 = 206/221;\ncmpRV = Table[{k[[1]] <> \"|\" <> k[[2]], Factor[cRV1[k]/guessRV[T1][k]], Factor[cRV2[k]/guessRV[T2][k]]}, {k, Keys[cRV1]}];\nGrid[Prepend[cmpRV, {\"g1|g2\", \"actual/guess, point 1 (h=1/3)\", \"actual/guess, point 2 (h=1/2)\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
