  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* gl(3): the 'singlet' of 8x8 is [2,2,2]: killed by off-diagonal generators, E_ii = 2 *)\nsing64 = First@NullSpace[Join @@ Flatten[Table[If[i != j, EEt[i, j], Nothing], {i, 3}, {j, 3}], 1]];\ngRows = rowG /@ Keys[locOps];\n(* symbolic-r check of the one-body property for the three survivors: every 8-vector row of the reshape is proportional to e8.g *)\noneBodySym[name_] := Module[{m = ArrayReshape[Expand[vg . locOps[name]], {8, 8}]}, And @@ Table[Expand[m[[i]] (e8g[[8]]) - m[[i, 8]] e8g] === ConstantArray[0, 8], {i, 8}] && e8g[[8]] =!= 0];\nsymCheck = Table[{n, oneBodySym[n]}, {n, {\"1\", \"t11\", \"R t11\"}}];\n{\"singlet: E_ii = 2\", Table[EEt[i, i] . sing64 == 2 sing64, {i, 3}], \"symbolic one-body\", symCheck}",
