  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings (2026-09-29): yes, via $R\\,t_{11}(\\theta_1)$ (exact; points 1 and 2)\n\nVacuum $\\langle v_g|=(e_8^Tg)\\otimes(e_8^Tg)$ with generic $g=e^{r_1E_{21}}e^{r_2E_{31}}e^{r_3E_{32}}$. We applied the 8 site-1-localizing combinations of the $\\langle0|=e_8\\otimes e_8$ table.\n\n| operator | one-body $(\\cdot)\\otimes e_8^Tg$? | singlet overlap |\n|---|---|---|\n| $1$, $t_{11}(\\theta_1)$ | yes, for all $r$ (symbolic) | 0 |\n| $R(\\theta_1)t_{11}(\\theta_1)$ | **yes, for all $r$** (symbolic) | $\\propto P_1(r)P_2(r)\\neq0$ |\n| $R(\\theta_1)$ | no (rank 7) | $\\propto P_1(r)^2$ |\n| rows 5–8 (dressed with $R(\\theta_2)$) | no (rank 8) | nonzero |\n\nIn terms of the companion first row $\\chi=(\\chi_1,\\chi_2,\\chi_3)$, the same form at both points:\n$$P_1=r_1-r_3-\\chi_1r_2+\\chi_2r_1r_2+\\chi_3r_2(r_2-r_1r_3),$$\n$$P_2=1+\\chi_1r_1+\\chi_2(r_2-r_1r_3)-\\chi_3\\big(r_1r_2+r_2r_3-r_1r_3^2\\big).$$\nBoth vanish at $r=0$ as needed; $P_2(0)=1$ and $P_1(0)=0$.\n\nSo a global rotation plus one site-1 operator, $R\\,t_{11}(\\theta_1)$, gives a **one-body** covector $\\langle a(r)|\\otimes\\langle e_8g|$ with nonzero singlet overlap. The site-2 factor is the rotated vacuum itself. The singlet is $g\\otimes g$-invariant, so this is equivalent to the site-1 factor $a\\,g^{-1}$ having an $e_1$ component in the unrotated frame. This reading is inferred, not checked separately.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## When does $\\langle v_g|R\\,t_{11}$ miss the singlet?\n\nOn $P_1P_2=0$. To interpret $P_1$ and $P_2$, compare them with entries and $2\\times2$ minors of the conjugated twist $g^{\\pm1}G_cg^{\\mp1}$ (and transposes). Here $g$ is in the fundamental with the same GT generators, and $\\chi$ is symbolic.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "P1s = r1 - r3 - c1 r2 + c2 r1 r2 + c3 r2 (r2 - r1 r3);\nP2s = 1 + c1 r1 + c2 (r2 - r1 r3) - c3 (r1 r2 + r2 r3 - r1 r3^2);\n(* check these reproduce the computed overlaps at point 1 (chi = 4, 11, -30) *)\nchk = {Factor[gRows1[[4, 2]]/((P1s P2s) /. {c1 -> 4, c2 -> 11, c3 -> -30})], Factor[gRows1[[3, 2]]/((P1s^2) /. {c1 -> 4, c2 -> 11, c3 -> -30})]};\nfnd = JJ[#1, #2, {1, 0, 0}] &;\ng3 = MatrixExp[r1 fnd[2, 1]] . MatrixExp[r2 fnd[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[r3 fnd[3, 2]];\nGcs = {{c1, c2, c3}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\ncands = <|\"g G g^-1\" -> g3 . Gcs . Inverse[g3], \"g^-1 G g\" -> Inverse[g3] . Gcs . g3, \"g^T G g^-T\" -> Transpose[g3] . Gcs . Inverse[Transpose[g3]], \"g^-T G g^T\" -> Inverse[Transpose[g3]] . Gcs . Transpose[g3]|>;\n(* which entries / 2x2 minors are proportional (constant factor) to P1 or P2? *)\npropTo[e_, P_] := With[{q = Simplify[e/P]}, If[FreeQ[q, r1 | r2 | r3] && q =!= 0, q, Nothing]];\nhits = Flatten@KeyValueMap[Function[{nm, M}, Join[\n      Flatten@Table[With[{a = propTo[M[[i, j]], P1s], b = propTo[M[[i, j]], P2s]}, {If[a =!= Nothing, {nm, \"entry\", {i, j}, \"P1\", a}, Nothing], If[b =!= Nothing, {nm, \"entry\", {i, j}, \"P2\", b}, Nothing]}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}],\n      Flatten@Table[With[{m = Det[M[[rs, cs]]]}, With[{a = propTo[m, P1s], b = propTo[m, P2s]}, {If[a =!= Nothing, {nm, \"minor\", {rs, cs}, \"P1\", a}, Nothing], If[b =!= Nothing, {nm, \"minor\", {rs, cs}, \"P2\", b}, Nothing]}]], {rs, Subsets[Range[3], {2}]}, {cs, Subsets[Range[3], {2}]}]]], cands];\n{\"overlap = const P1 P2, R: const P1^2\", chk, \"hits\", Length[hits]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"42\" data-out-n=\"261\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"52\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"13\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[261]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"33\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRce1x0ZXh0e292ZXJsYXAgPSBjb25zdCBQMSBQMiwgUjogY29uc3QgUDFcXnt9Mn0sXGxlZnRcey1cZnJhY3sxNzY3MjB9ezExMDkzNzUxOX0sLVxmcmFjezQ3MH17MTE4NTAzfVxyaWdodFx9LFx0ZXh0e2hpdHN9LDBccmlnaHRcfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">overlap = const P1 P2, R: const P1</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">110937519</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">176720</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">118503</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">470</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">}</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hits</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[261]= \\left\\{\\text{overlap = const P1 P2, R: const P1\\^{}2},\\left\\{-\\frac{176720}{110937519},-\\frac{470}{118503}\\right\\},\\text{hits},0\\right\\}",
