     "id": "83b8bc77-8632-41a5-b8d6-49d966ee4997"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: the singlet is missed only on $P_1P_2=0$\n\n$\\langle v_g|R\\,t_{11}(\\theta_1)|s\\rangle=\\text{const}\\cdot P_1P_2$ was checked exactly against the symbolic-$\\chi$ formulas at point 1. Both $P$'s are linear in $r_1$, so the bad set is two surfaces:\n$$P_1=0:\\ r_1=\\frac{r_3+\\chi_1r_2-\\chi_3r_2^2}{1+\\chi_2r_2-\\chi_3r_2r_3},\\qquad P_2=0:\\ r_1=-\\frac{1+\\chi_2r_2-\\chi_3r_2r_3}{\\chi_1-\\chi_2r_3-\\chi_3r_2+\\chi_3r_3^2}.$$\nExamples:\n- $r=0$ lies on $P_1=0$.\n- With $r_2=0$, $P_1=r_1-r_3$, so $r_1=r_3$ misses the singlet.\n- With $r_2=0$, $P_2=0$ at $r_1=-1/(\\chi_1-\\chi_2r_3+\\chi_3r_3^2)$.\n\nThe $P$'s are not entries or $2\\times2$ minors of $AG_cB$, $A,B\\in\\{1,g^{\\pm1},g^{\\pm T}\\}$, $G_c$ or $G_c^T$, $r\\to\\pm r$. There is no geometric reading yet.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Rotated vacuum as a left eigenstate for a new twist $w$\n\nClaim to test: for suitable $r$, $\\langle v_g|=(e_8^Tg)^{\\otimes2}$ is a left eigenvector of $t_{\\{1,0\\}},t_{\\{1,1\\}}$ built with the companion twist $G_c(w)$ of eigenvalues $w$. Candidate mechanism: $g^{\\pm1}G_c(w)g^{\\mp1}$ triangular, so the rotated vacuum is a reference state for the twist-$w$ chain. Test at $w=(7/3,-1/2,4)$, current point (point 1, chain twist $z=(2,-3,5)$). Solve the $3\\times3$ triangularity conditions, then verify on the 64-dim space.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wv = {7/3, -1/2, 4};\nchiW = {Total[wv], -(wv[[1]] wv[[2]] + wv[[1]] wv[[3]] + wv[[2]] wv[[3]]), Times @@ wv};\nGw = {chiW, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\n(* untwisted monodromy bT (point 1) times a twist; t10 and t11 for any twist matrix *)\nTGw[Gm_][{i_, j_}][u_] := Sum[bT[{i, k}][u] Gm[[k, j]], {k, 3}];\ntw10[Gm_][u_] := Sum[TGw[Gm][{i, i}][u], {i, 3}];\ntw11[Gm_][u_] := Sum[TGw[Gm][{a, a}][u] . TGw[Gm][{b, b}][u - ah] - TGw[Gm][{b, a}][u] . TGw[Gm][{a, b}][u - ah], {a, 3}, {b, a + 1, 3}];\n(* sanity: with Gm = cG this reproduces ct *)\nsanityTw = {tw10[cG][1/7] == ct[{1, 0}][1/7], tw11[cG][1/7] == ct[{1, 1}][1/7]};\n(* triangularity of the conjugated twist, 4 conjugations x {lower, upper} *)\nconjs = <|\"g G g^-1\" -> g3 . Gw . Inverse[g3], \"g^-1 G g\" -> Inverse[g3] . Gw . g3|>;\noffL = {{1, 2}, {1, 3}, {2, 3}}; offU = {{2, 1}, {3, 1}, {3, 2}};\ntriSols = Association@Flatten@Table[{nm, tri} -> Quiet@Solve[Thread[(Extract[conjs[nm], If[tri == \"lower\", offL, offU]]) == 0], {r1, r2, r3}], {nm, Keys[conjs]}, {tri, {\"lower\", \"upper\"}}];\n{\"tw reproduces ct\", sanityTw, \"# solutions\", Length /@ triSols}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"44\" data-out-n=\"277\" data-sub-idx=\"13\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"56\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"13\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[277]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"33\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\