  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* for each triangularising r: is <v_g| a left eigenvector of tw10, tw11 with twist Gw (generic u)? eigenvalues; diagonal of the conjugated twist; singlet overlap of <v_g| R t11 (chain twist z: chi = 4, 11, -30) *)\nuT = 3/11;\nM10 = tw10[Gw][uT]; M11 = tw11[Gw][uT];\neigTest[nm_, sol_] := Module[{v = vg /. sol, a, b},\n   a = v . M10; b = v . M11;\n   {nm, {r1, r2, r3} /. sol, Diagonal[conjs[nm] /. sol], MatrixRank[{v, a}] == 1 && MatrixRank[{v, b}] == 1,\n    (P1s P2s /. {c1 -> 4, c2 -> 11, c3 -> -30}) /. sol}];\neigRows = Flatten[Table[eigTest[nm, s], {nm, Keys[conjs]}, {s, triSols[{nm, \"upper\"}]}], 1];\nGrid[Prepend[eigRows, {\"conjugation (upper-triangular)\", \"{r1, r2, r3}\", \"diagonal\", \"<v_g| left eigenvector of t10, t11 (twist w)\", \"P1 P2 (chain twist z)\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"45\" data-out-n=\"282\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"57\" data-sub-start=\"8\" data-sub-end=\"8\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[282]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"33\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:15.76em;vertical-align:-7.61em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.11em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:15.72em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-7.61em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.11em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.27em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">conjugation (upper-triangular)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g G g</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span