  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (1) intertwiner: Pi(g) t_G Pi(g)^-1 = t_{G'} for which G'? numeric r, numeric twist *)\nrN = {r1 -> 2/5, r2 -> -3/7, r3 -> 5/3};\nPig = KroneckerProduct[rot1, rot1] /. rN; gN = g3 /. rN;\nGtest = {{2, 1, -1}, {3, 0, 1}, {1, -2, 4}};\nlhs10 = Pig . tw10[Gtest][uT] . Inverse[Pig];\nGcands = <|\"g G g^-1\" -> gN . Gtest . Inverse[gN], \"g^-1 G g\" -> Inverse[gN] . Gtest . gN, \"g^T G g^-T\" -> Transpose[gN] . Gtest . Inverse[Transpose[gN]], \"g^-T G g^T\" -> Inverse[Transpose[gN]] . Gtest . Transpose[gN]|>;\nintertw1 = Map[tw10[#][uT] == lhs10 &, Gcands];\n(* (2) which twist shapes make e8 (x) e8 a left eigenvector? *)\nshapeTest[Gm_] := MatrixRank[{vac0, vac0 . tw10[Gm][uT]}] == 1 && MatrixRank[{vac0, vac0 . tw11[Gm][uT]}] == 1;\nshapes = <|\"diagonal\" -> shapeTest[DiagonalMatrix[{2, -3, 5}]], \"upper\" -> shapeTest[{{2, 1, 3}, {0, -3, 4}, {0, 0, 5}}], \"lower\" -> shapeTest[{{2, 0, 0}, {1, -3, 0}, {3, 4, 5}}]|>;\n{\"intertwiner\", intertw1, \"vacuum eigen for twist shape\", shapes}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
