      {
       "data": "Out[304]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{\\{r1, r2, r3\\}} & \\text{diag of g Gc(w) g\\^{}-1} & \\text{<v\\_g| left eigenvector of t10, t11 (twist w)} & \\text{t10 eigenvalue at u} & \\text{P1 P2 (chain twist z)}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{-\\frac{3}{7},-\\frac{6}{7},\\frac{11}{7}\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\frac{7}{3},-\\frac{1}{2},4\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & -\\frac{904}{7623} & -\\frac{32768}{117649}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{-\\frac{3}{7},\\frac{3}{28},-\\frac{19}{28}\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\frac{7}{3},4,-\\frac{1}{2}\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & -\\frac{4171}{7623} & \\frac{4096}{117649}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{-\\frac{1}{4},-\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{7}{4}\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,-\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{7}{3}\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & -\\frac{1502}{22869} & -\\frac{49}{512}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{-\\frac{1}{4},\\frac{3}{28},-\\frac{19}{28}\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,\\frac{7}{3},-\\frac{1}{2}\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & -\\frac{7673}{22869} & \\frac{21}{1024}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,-\\frac{6}{7},\\frac{11}{7}\\right\\} & \\left\\{-\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{7}{3},4\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & -\\frac{10940}{22869} & \\frac{226875}{7}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,-\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{7}{4}\\right\\} & \\left\\{-\\frac{1}{2},4,\\frac{7}{3}\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True} & -\\frac{14570}{22869} & \\frac{75625}{4}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "63c66f12-fa84-4d2f-a452-72b4aa786e66"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* symbolic w: closed form r(w) for the identity ordering (diag = w1, w2, w3), and the singlet overlap in terms of w and the chain twist z *)\nGws = {{w1 + w2 + w3, -(w1 w2 + w1 w3 + w2 w3), w1 w2 w3}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nconjWs = gS . Gws . Inverse[gS];\nsolsWs = Solve[Thread[Extract[conjWs, {{2, 1}, {3, 1}, {3, 2}}] == 0], {r1, r2, r3}];\nsolId = First@Select[solsWs, Simplify[Diagonal[conjWs /. #] == {w1, w2, w3}] &];\nrOfW = Simplify[{r1, r2, r3} /. solId];\n(* chain twist z symbolic too: chi(z) *)\nchiZ = {z1 + z2 + z3, -(z1 z2 + z1 z3 + z2 z3), z1 z2 z3};\nP1w = Factor[P1s /. Thread[{c1, c2, c3} -> chiZ] /. solId];\nP2w = Factor[P2s /. Thread[{c1, c2, c3} -> chiZ] /. solId];\n{\"r(w), identity ordering\", rOfW, \"P1\", P1w, \"P2\", P2w}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
