   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: why the earlier attempts missed the singlet (point 1, exact)\n\n- **$R(\\theta_1)$ localizes iff $P_1=0$.** $\\langle v_g|R(\\theta_1)$ is one-body with site 2 $=e_8^Tg$ exactly on $P_1=0$: all 214 localization minors vanish there symbolically. It fails at generic $r$ and on $P_2=0$. That is the same surface where $\\langle v_g|R\\,t_{11}$ has zero singlet overlap.\n- **The earlier families.** The unrotated companion vacuum and, presumably, the diagonal-frame rotparams family of `L2-localization-tests` were set up so that $R$ *and* $t_{11}$ localize, i.e. they sit on $P_1=0$. That explains the zero singlet there. The mapping of rotparams to $P_1=0$ is inferred, not recomputed.\n- **What is new.** Leave $P_1=0$ and give up $R$ alone. Only $1$, $t_{11}$ and $R\\,t_{11}$ then stay one-body, and $R\\,t_{11}$ reaches the singlet. The twist-$w$ reference vacua have $P_1\\propto\\det(w_1-G_c(z))\\neq0$, so they are of this new kind.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Components of $\\langle v|=\\langle ag^{-1}|$, companion and diagonal frames\n\nCompanion: $v(r)=a(r)g^{-1}$ from $\\langle v_g|R\\,t_{11}\\,\\Pi(g)^{-1}=\\langle v|\\otimes e_8^T$. Diagonal frame: $G_c=PG_dP^{-1}$ with $P=(z_a^2,z_a,1)$ as columns. If $\\Pi(P)t_{G_d}\\Pi(P)^{-1}=t_{G_c}$ (checked below), a companion covector $X$ maps to $X\\,\\Pi(P)$. So $\\langle v|\\otimes e_8^T\\mapsto(v\\Pi_1(P))\\otimes(e_8^T\\Pi_2(P))$. $\\Pi$ on the 8-dim rep is built by LDU (as in `L2-localization-tests` cell 29) with the same generators `aE`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* GL(3) element on the 8-dim rep via g = L.D.U, consistent with rot1 (exp of aE <-> standard units) *)\nlduD[gm_] := Module[{l21, l31, l32, dd1, dd2, dd3, u12, u13, u23, L, D, U, s},\n   L = {{1, 0, 0}, {l21, 1, 0}, {l31, l32, 1}}; U = {{1, u12, u13}, {0, 1, u23}, {0, 0, 1}}; D = DiagonalMatrix[{dd1, dd2, dd3}];\n   s = First@Solve[Thread[Flatten[L . D . U - gm] == 0], {l21, l31, l32, dd1, dd2, dd3, u12, u13, u23}];\n   {L, D, U} /. s];\nPi8[gm_] := Module[{L, D, U, lg, ug, wts},\n   {L, D, U} = lduD[gm];\n   lg = (L - IdentityMatrix[3]) - (L - IdentityMatrix[3]) . (L - IdentityMatrix[3])/2;\n   ug = (U - IdentityMatrix[3]) - (U - IdentityMatrix[3]) . (U - IdentityMatrix[3])/2;\n   wts = Transpose[Diagonal /@ Table[aE[i, i], {i, 3}]];\n   MatrixExp[Sum[lg[[i, j]] aE[i, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]] . DiagonalMatrix[Times @@ (Diagonal[D]^#) & /@ wts] . MatrixExp[Sum[ug[[i, j]] aE[i, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]]];\n(* checks: Pi8 reproduces rot1 on g = gS; intertwiner companion <-> diagonal at point 1 *)\nzD = {2, -3, 5}; Gd1 = DiagonalMatrix[zD]; Pz = Transpose[{#^2, #, 1} & /@ zD];\nchkPi = {Pi8[gSN] == (rot1 /. rN), Pz . Gd1 . Inverse[Pz] == cG};\nPiP = KroneckerProduct[Pi8[Pz], Pi8[Pz]];\nchkInt = PiP . tw10[Gd1][uT] . Inverse[PiP] == tw10[cG][uT];\n{\"Pi8(g) = rot1\", chkPi[[1]], \"Gc = P Gd P^-1\", chkPi[[2]], \"Pi(P) t_d Pi(P)^-1 = t_c\", chkInt}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"52\" data-out-n=\"336\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"70\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"16\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[336]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"33\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FsaWduZWR9CiAgJlxsZWZ0XHtcdGV4dHtQaTgoZykgPSByb3QxfSxcbWF0aHJte1RydWV9LFx0ZXh0e0djID0gUCBHZCBQXF57fS0xfSxcbWF0aHJte1RydWV9LFx0ZXh0e1BpKFApIHRcX2QgUGkoUClcXnt9LTEgPSB0XF9jfSBccmlnaHQuIFxcCiAgJlxsZWZ0LiAsXG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfVxyaWdodFx9ClxlbmR7YWxpZ25lZH0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.01em;vertical-align:-1.255em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.755em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.755em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.255em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.755em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.905em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Pi8(g) = rot1</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Gc = P Gd P</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-1</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Pi(P) t_d Pi(P)</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-1 = t_c</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.405em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.255em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[336]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{Pi8(g) = rot1},\\mathrm{True},\\text{Gc = P Gd P\\^{}-1},\\mathrm{True},\\text{Pi(P) t\\_d Pi(P)\\^{}-1 = t\\_c} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "f2f28ca6-ece7-4839-8c39-fbe14a40bd93"
    }
