  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* companion: v(r) = a g^-1, symbolic r *)\nvC = Factor[aGinv];\nvCzero = Flatten@Position[vC, 0];\n(* diagonal frame: both site factors *)\nP8 = Pi8[Pz];\nvD = Factor[vC . P8];\ne8D = UnitVector[8, 8] . P8;\nvDzero = Flatten@Position[vD, 0];\n(* at the six twist-w points and one generic point: which components vanish *)\nzerosAt[s_] := {Flatten@Position[vC /. s, 0], Flatten@Position[vD /. s, 0]};\nzw = Table[zerosAt[s], {s, Join[solsW, {rN}]}];\nwtsV8 = Transpose[Diagonal /@ Table[aE[i, i], {i, 3}]];\n{\"GT weights e1..e8\", wtsV8, \"companion: identically-zero components of v\", vCzero, \"diagonal: identically-zero of v.Pi(P)\", vDzero, \"diagonal site-2 factor e8.Pi(P) zeros\", Flatten@Position[e8D, 0], \"zeros at 6 w-points + generic {companion, diagonal}\", zw}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
