<span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.416em;\"></span><span style=\"height:2.416em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"2.416em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 2416\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V2416 H384z M384 0 H504 V2416 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.966em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.416em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎫</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:12.0501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[346]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{GT weights e1..e8},\\begin{pmatrix}2 & 1 & 0\\\\2 & 0 & 1\\\\1 & 2 & 0\\\\1 & 1 & 1\\\\1 & 1 & 1\\\\1 & 0 & 2\\\\0 & 2 & 1\\\\0 & 1 & 2\\end{pmatrix} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{companion: identically-zero components of v} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\{\\},\\text{diagonal: identically-zero of v.Pi(P)},\\{\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{diagonal site-2 factor e8.Pi(P) zeros},\\{\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{zeros at 6 w-points + generic \\{companion, diagonal\\}} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{2,6\\right\\} & \\{\\}\\\\\\left\\{2,6\\right\\} & \\{\\}\\\\\\left\\{2,6\\right\\} & \\{\\}\\\\\\left\\{2,6\\right\\} & \\{\\}\\\\\\left\\{2,6\\right\\} & \\{\\}\\\\\\left\\{2,6\\right\\} & \\{\\}\\\\\\{\\} & \\{\\}\\end{pmatrix}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "c7333bb9-1872-48dd-8d42-4c99e79aa68b"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: components of $v$ (exact, point 1)\n\nChecks first: `Pi8` reproduces the rotation, $G_c=PG_dP^{-1}$, and $\\Pi(P)t_{G_d}\\Pi(P)^{-1}=t_{G_c}$.\n\n| | companion $v=ag^{-1}$ | diagonal $v\\,\\Pi_1(P)$ | diagonal site 2, $e_8^T\\Pi_2(P)$ |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| generic $r$ | all 8 nonzero | all 8 nonzero | all 8 nonzero |\n| six twist-$w$ points | $v_2=v_6=0$, weights $(2,0,1)$ and $(1,0,2)$ | all 8 nonzero | all 8 nonzero |\n\n$v_2\\propto(r_1^2+r_2-r_1r_3)P_1$ and $v_6\\propto r_2(r_1^2+r_2-r_1r_3)$. The factor $r_1^2+r_2-r_1r_3$ is twist-independent and vanishes on the whole twist-$w$ family ($r_2=r_1(r_3-r_1)$). The reading — that the first column of $g^{-1}$ has the companion-eigenvector shape $(1,-r_1,r_1^2)$ — comes from the solution, not a separate check.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Moving the site-2 factor to $e_1$\n\nFrom the diagonal frame, $h=P^{-1}w_0$ with $w_0=s_1s_2s_1$, $s_i=e^{E_{i,i+1}}e^{-E_{i+1,i}}e^{E_{i,i+1}}$. Then $e_8^T\\Pi(P)\\Pi(h)=e_8^T\\Pi(w_0)\\propto e_1^T$. The new twist is $h^{-1}G_dh=w_0^{-1}G_cw_0$, which is no longer diagonal: no rotation commuting with $\\mathrm{diag}(z)$ can move $e_8^T\\Pi(P)$ to $e_1^T$. The covector becomes $(v\\,\\Pi(w_0))\\otimes e_1^T$ up to scale.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: site-2 factor moved to $e_1$ (exact, point 1)\n\n- $h=P^{-1}w_0$ gives the covector $\\langle v'|\\otimes\\tfrac13e_1^T$ with $v'=v\\,\\Pi(w_0)$. The twist becomes $w_0^{-1}G_cw_0=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1&0\\\\0&0&-1\\\\-30&-11&4\\end{pmatrix}$: the companion with $\\chi$ in the bottom row. Checked: $\\Pi(h)^{-1}t_{G_d}\\Pi(h)=t_{h^{-1}G_dh}$.\n- The singlet overlap is unchanged (ratio exactly 1). It now sits in $v'_8$, since $e_8$ pairs with $e_1$.\n- **Generic $r$:** all 8 components of $v'$ are nonzero.\n- **Twist-$w$ points:** $v'_2=v'_6=0$. $w_0$ swaps weights $(2,0,1)\\leftrightarrow(1,0,2)$, so these are the same two zeros as in the companion frame.\n- $h$ can be multiplied by any upper-Borel $b$, as $h=P^{-1}bw_0$, since $b$ fixes $e_8^T$ up to scale. That freedom rotates $v'$ further. It was not used here.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Other representations: $[3,1,0]^{\\otimes2}$ and $[3,2,0]^{\\otimes2}$\n\nNeither square contains the gl(3) singlet: $[3,1,0]$ is dual to $[3,2,0]$ up to $\\det$. The analog targets are the irreps the earlier families missed, those with $\\Lambda_3>\\lambda_2$: $[4,2,2]$ and $[3,3,2]$ in $[3,1,0]^2$, and $[4,3,3]$ in $[3,2,0]^2$.\n\nSame pipeline for each rep, companion frame, point 1:\n1. Vacuum $\\langle v_g|=(\\mathrm{lw}^Tg)^{\\otimes2}$.\n2. Candidate site-1 operators at $\\theta_1$.\n3. One-body test (site 2 $\\propto\\mathrm{lw}^Tg$).\n4. Reach of each irrep, via overlap with its isotypic component. $X$ meets irrep $\\Lambda$ iff $X\\,\\Pi(k)\\,|\\mathrm{hw}_\\Lambda\\rangle\\neq0$ for a generic group element $k$.\n\nThe adjoint is run through the same code as a control.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "repPipeline[rep_, rNum_] := Module[{d, E, L, T, TG, QMr, t, t20, t21, Rop, ops, lw, g, vgR, EEr, wts, hws, Pik, kk, kmat, hwGroups, reach, oneBody, h = 1/3, th = {2/7, -5/11}, Gm = {{4, 11, -30}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}}, u1, res},\n   d = dim[rep]; E[i_, j_] := E[i, j] = JJ[i, j, rep];\n   L[i_, j_][u_] := u IdentityMatrix[d] KroneckerDelta[i, j] - h E[j, i];\n   T[{i_, j_}][u_] := T[{i, j}][u] = Sum[KroneckerProduct[L[i, k][u - th[[1]]], L[k, l][u - th[[2]]]] Gm[[l, j]], {k, 3}, {l, 3}];\n   QMr[Ii_][u_] := Sum[Signature[p] (Dot @@ Table[T[{p[[k]], Ii[[k]]}][u + h - k h], {k, Length[Ii]}]), {p, Permutations[Ii]}];\n   t[a_][u_] := t[a][u] = Sum[QMr[Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\n   t20[u_] := t[1][u] . t[1][u + h] - t[2][u + h];\n   t21[u_] := t[2][u] . t[1][u + h] - t[3][u + h];\n   u1 = th[[1]];\n   Rop = t20[u1] . Inverse[t[1][u1]];\n   ops = <|\"t10\" -> t[1][u1], \"t11\" -> t[2][u1], \"t20\" -> t20[u1], \"t21\" -> t21[u1], \"R\" -> Rop, \"R t11\" -> Rop . t[2][u1], \"R t20\" -> Rop . t20[u1], \"R t21\" -> Rop . t21[u1], \"t11^2\" -> t[2][u1] . t[2][u1]|>;\n   (* lowest weight = last GT vector; rotation with standard-unit-consistent generators *)\n   lw = UnitVector[d, d];\n   g = MatrixExp[r1 E[2, 1]] . MatrixExp[r2 E[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[r3 E[3, 2]] /. rNum;\n   vgR = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[lw . g, lw . g]];\n   (* irreps: hw vectors = common kernel of the raising coproduct generators, grouped by weight *)\n   EEr[i_, j_] := KroneckerProduct[E[i, j], IdentityMatrix[d]] + KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[d], E[i, j]];\n   wts = Transpose[Diagonal /@ Table[EEr[i, i], {i, 3}]];\n   hws = NullSpace[Join[EEr[1, 2], EEr[2, 3]]];\n   hwGroups = GatherBy[hws, wts[[First@FirstPosition[#, x_ /; x != 0]]] &];\n   (* generic group element on the tensor product: k = exp(lower) exp(upper) with fixed rational angles *)\n   kmat = MatrixExp[2/3 E[2, 1] - 1/2 E[3, 1] + 3/5 E[3, 2]] . MatrixExp[-1/4 E[1, 2] + 2/7 E[1, 3] + 1/3 E[2, 3]];\n   Pik = KroneckerProduct[kmat, kmat];\n   reach[X_] := Association@Table[wts[[First@FirstPosition[grp[[1]], x_ /; x != 0]]] -> MatrixRank[{(X . Pik) . # & /@ grp}], {grp, hwGroups}];\n   oneBody[X_] := Module[{m = ArrayReshape[X, {d, d}]}, MatrixRank[Append[Select[m, Max[Abs[#]] > 0 &], lw . g]] == 1];\n   res = Association@KeyValueMap[#1 -> {oneBody[vgR . #2], reach[vgR . #2]} &, ops];\n   <|\"dim\" -> d, \"irreps (hw weight -> multiplicity)\" -> Association[(wts[[First@FirstPosition[#[[1]], x_ /; x != 0]]] -> Length[#]) & /@ hwGroups], \"vacuum reach\" -> reach[vgR], \"ops\" -> res|>];\n(* control: adjoint at generic r and at r = 0 *)\nrGen = {r1 -> 2/5, r2 -> -3/7, r3 -> 5/3}; rZero = {r1 -> 0, r2 -> 0, r3 -> 0};\nAbsoluteTiming[adjGen = repPipeline[{2, 1, 0}, rGen];][[1]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"55\" data-out-n=\"361\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"76\" data-sub-start=\"29\" data-sub-end=\"29\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[361]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"33\" data-latex-b64=\"MC41NDcxODc=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.547187</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[361]= 0.547187",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "d79eafd3-a85c-4257-959a-a585c3396fff"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* run both reps at generic r and at r = 0 (unrotated control) *)\nAbsoluteTiming[\n  runs = <|{\"[2,1,0]\", \"generic r\"} -> adjGen, {\"[2,1,0]\", \"r = 0\"} -> repPipeline[{2, 1, 0}, rZero],\n    {\"[3,1,0]\", \"generic r\"} -> repPipeline[{3, 1, 0}, rGen], {\"[3,1,0]\", \"r = 0\"} -> repPipeline[{3, 1, 0}, rZero],\n    {\"[3,2,0]\", \"generic r\"} -> repPipeline[{3, 2, 0}, rGen], {\"[3,2,0]\", \"r = 0\"} -> repPipeline[{3, 2, 0}, rZero]|>;][[1]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"56\" data-out-n=\"362\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"77\" data-sub-start=\"1\" data-sub-end=\"4\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[362]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"33\" data-latex-b64=\"NjMuNzc3NDA1\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">63.777405</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
