  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings (2026-09-29, point 1, companion frame; exact)\n\nOperators at $\\theta_1$: $t_{10},t_{11},t_{20},t_{21},R=t_{20}t_{10}^{-1},Rt_{11},Rt_{20},Rt_{21},t_{11}^2$. Vacuum $(\\mathrm{lw}^Tg)^{\\otimes2}$ at generic $r$, and at $r=0$ as control. Listed: operators that stay one-body, and the irreps each reaches.\n\n**Control, $[2,1,0]^2$ (singlet $[2,2,2]$).** Generic $r$: $t_{11}$ is one-body, with no singlet. $t_{21}$ and $Rt_{11}$ are one-body and reach all six irreps, singlet included. At $r=0$: $t_{11},t_{21},R,Rt_{11}$ are one-body, and none reaches the singlet. This reproduces the earlier result.\n\n**$[3,1,0]^2$.** Irreps: $[3,3,2],[4,2,2],[4,3,1]^2,[4,4,0],[5,2,1]^2,[5,3,0],[6,1,1],[6,2,0]$.\n- Generic $r$: $t_{21}$ and $Rt_{11}$ are one-body. They reach $[4,2,2]$ (**new**), $[4,3,1],[5,2,1],[5,3,0],[6,1,1],[6,2,0]$.\n- They miss $[3,3,2]$ and $[4,4,0]$.\n- At $r=0$: the same operators (plus $R$) miss $[4,2,2]$ as well.\n- So the rotation recovers one of the two previously missed irreps. $[3,3,2]$ stays missed.\n\n**$[3,2,0]^2$.** Irreps: $[4,3,3],[4,4,2],[5,3,2]^2,[5,4,1]^2,[5,5,0],[6,2,2],[6,3,1],[6,4,0]$.\n- Only $t_{11}$ is one-body, generic $r$ or $r=0$. It reaches $[5,4,1],[6,3,1],[6,4,0]$.\n- $R$, $Rt_{11}$ and $t_{21}$ at $\\theta_1$ do **not** localize here even unrotated. For $\\lambda_2=2$ the site-1 tower must differ: e.g. $t_{\\{2,2\\}}$ and the shifted special point $\\theta_1+3h$ seen in the $P$-bilinear scan. Not tried.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Wider operator pool (the operators of the other notebooks)\n\nThree families, at $x=\\theta_1+nh$, $n=-1..4$:\n- fused $t_{10},t_{11},t_{20},t_{21},t_{22}$ with $t_{22}(x)=t_2(x)t_2(x+h)-t_3(x+h)t_1(x)$ (`L2-localizing-transfer`);\n- the ratio $R(x)=t_{20}(x)t_{10}(x)^{-1}$;\n- the companion pieces $P_{a,r}(x)$, defined by $t_a=\\sum_r\\chi_rP_{a,r}$ with $\\chi_0=1$ (`L2-localization-tests` cells 147–159).\n\nAlso tested: all products $O_1O_2$ where $O_1$ is one-body on the vacuum, plus the scan's four localizing $P$-bilinears at the rep's special points. Operators act on covectors (row vector times matrix, $t_{10}^{-1}$ via LinearSolve). For every one-body covector we record the irreps reached, and also the union over all of them.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "buildRep[rep_, rNum_] := Module[{d, E, L, Tu, TG, QMg, ta, Gc0 = {{4, 11, -30}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}}, h = 1/3, th = {2/7, -5/11}, lw, g, vg0, EEr, wts, hws, hwGroups, kmat, Pik, Gchi, Pp, act, pool, pts},\n   d = dim[rep]; E[i_, j_] := E[i, j] = JJ[i, j, rep];\n   L[i_, j_][u_] := u IdentityMatrix[d] KroneckerDelta[i, j] - h E[j, i];\n   Tu[{i_, j_}][u_] := Tu[{i, j}][u] = Sum[KroneckerProduct[L[i, k][u - th[[1]]], L[k, j][u - th[[2]]]], {k, 3}];\n   TG[Gm_][{i_, j_}][u_] := TG[Gm][{i, j}][u] = Sum[Tu[{i, k}][u] Gm[[k, j]], {k, 3}];\n   QMg[Gm_][Ii_][u_] := Sum[Signature[p] (Dot @@ Table[TG[Gm][{p[[k]], Ii[[k]]}][u + h - k h], {k, Length[Ii]}]), {p, Permutations[Ii]}];\n   ta[Gm_][a_][u_] := ta[Gm][a][u] = Sum[QMg[Gm][Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\n   (* companion pieces: t_a is affine in chi *)\n   Gchi[c_] := {c, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\n   Pp[a_, 0][u_] := ta[Gchi[{0, 0, 0}]][a][u];\n   Pp[a_, r_][u_] := ta[Gchi[UnitVector[3, r]]][a][u] - Pp[a, 0][u];\n   (* operators as maps on row covectors, twist Gc0 *)\n   act[\"t10\", x_][w_] := w . ta[Gc0][1][x];\n   act[\"t11\", x_][w_] := w . ta[Gc0][2][x];\n   act[\"t20\", x_][w_] := w . ta[Gc0][1][x] . ta[Gc0][1][x + h] - w . ta[Gc0][2][x + h];\n   act[\"t21\", x_][w_] := w . ta[Gc0][2][x] . ta[Gc0][1][x + h] - w . ta[Gc0][3][x + h];\n   act[\"t22\", x_][w_] := w . ta[Gc0][2][x] . ta[Gc0][2][x + h] - w . ta[Gc0][3][x + h] . ta[Gc0][1][x];\n   act[\"R\", x_][w_] := Quiet@Check[LinearSolve[Transpose[ta[Gc0][1][x]], act[\"t20\", x][w]], $Failed];\n   act[{\"P\", a_, r_}, x_][w_] := w . Pp[a, r][x];\n   (* bilinear X = P_{a,r}(u) P_{b,s}(v) - P_{b,r}(v) P_{a,s}(u) *)\n   act[{\"B\", a_, b_, r_, s_}, {u_, v_}][w_] := w . Pp[a, r][u] . Pp[b, s][v] - w . Pp[b, r][v] . Pp[a, s][u];\n   lw = UnitVector[d, d];\n   g = MatrixExp[r1 E[2, 1]] . MatrixExp[r2 E[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[r3 E[3, 2]] /. rNum;\n   vg0 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[lw . g, lw . g]];\n   EEr[i_, j_] := KroneckerProduct[E[i, j], IdentityMatrix[d]] + KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[d], E[i, j]];\n   wts = Transpose[Diagonal /@ Table[EEr[i, i], {i, 3}]];\n   hws = NullSpace[Join[EEr[1, 2], EEr[2, 3]]];\n   hwGroups = GatherBy[hws, wts[[First@FirstPosition[#, x_ /; x != 0]]] &];\n   kmat = MatrixExp[2/3 E[2, 1] - 1/2 E[3, 1] + 3/5 E[3, 2]] . MatrixExp[-1/4 E[1, 2] + 2/7 E[1, 3] + 1/3 E[2, 3]];\n   Pik = KroneckerProduct[kmat, kmat];\n   <|\"d\" -> d, \"act\" -> act, \"vac\" -> vg0, \"lwg\" -> lw . g, \"th1\" -> th[[1]], \"h\" -> h,\n     \"hwImg\" -> Table[{wts[[First@FirstPosition[grp[[1]], x_ /; x != 0]]], (Pik . #) & /@ grp}, {grp, hwGroups}]|>];\n(* one-body test and reach for a covector in a built rep *)\noneBodyR[B_, w_] := w =!= $Failed && Max[Abs[w]] > 0 && With[{m = ArrayReshape[w, {B[\"d\"], B[\"d\"]}]}, MatrixRank[Append[Select[m, Max[Abs[#]] > 0 &], B[\"lwg\"]]] == 1];\nreachR[B_, w_] := Select[B[\"hwImg\"], MatrixRank[{w . # & /@ #[[2]]}] > 0 &][[All, 1]];\n(* scan: singles, products O1 O2 with O1 one-body, and the scan's bilinears *)\nscanRep[B_, bilinPts_] := Module[{x0 = B[\"th1\"], h = B[\"h\"], names, singles, sOK, prods, bils, all},\n   names = Join[Flatten[Table[{nm, x0 + n h}, {nm, {\"t10\", \"t11\", \"t20\", \"t21\", \"t22\", \"R\"}}, {n, -1, 4}], 1],\n     Flatten[Table[{{\"P\", a, r}, x0 + n h}, {a, 2}, {r, 0, 3}, {n, -1, 4}], 2]];\n   singles = Table[{nm, B[\"act\"][nm[[1]], nm[[2]]][B[\"vac\"]]}, {nm, names}];\n   sOK = Select[singles, oneBodyR[B, #[[2]]] &];\n   prods = Flatten[Table[With[{w2 = B[\"act\"][n2[[1]], n2[[2]]][s[[2]]]}, If[oneBodyR[B, w2], {{s[[1]], n2}, w2}, Nothing]], {s, sOK}, {n2, names}], 1];\n   bils = Table[With[{w = B[\"act\"][bb[[1]], bb[[2]]][B[\"vac\"]]}, If[oneBodyR[B, w], {bb, w}, Nothing]], {bb, bilinPts}];\n   all = Join[sOK, prods, bils];\n   <|\"one-body singles\" -> ({#[[1]], reachR[B, #[[2]]]} & /@ sOK), \"one-body products\" -> ({#[[1]], reachR[B, #[[2]]]} & /@ prods), \"one-body bilinears\" -> ({#[[1]], reachR[B, #[[2]]]} & /@ bils),\n     \"union reach\" -> Union[Flatten[reachR[B, #[[2]]] & /@ all, 1]], \"all irreps\" -> B[\"hwImg\"][[All, 1]]|>];\n(* the scan's localizing bilinears, special point xs = th1 + (lambda2+1) h *)\nbilinFor[B_, lam2_] := With[{x0 = B[\"th1\"], xs = B[\"th1\"] + (lam2 + 1) B[\"h\"]},\n   {{{\"B\", 1, 2, 0, 1}, {x0 + B[\"h\"]/7, x0}}, {{\"B\", 2, 2, 0, 2}, {x0, x0 + B[\"h\"]/5}}, {{\"B\", 2, 2, 1, 2}, {xs, x0 + B[\"h\"]/5}}, {{\"B\", 2, 2, 0, 1}, {xs, x0}}, {{\"B\", 1, 2, 0, 1}, {xs, xs}}}];\nAbsoluteTiming[Badj = buildRep[{2, 1, 0}, rGen]; scAdj = scanRep[Badj, bilinFor[Badj, 1]];][[1]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
