  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the 7 one-body triples for [3,1,0], with their reach *)\ndeeperList[B_, sc_] := Module[{x0 = B[\"th1\"], h = B[\"h\"], names, starts},\n   names = Join[Flatten[Table[{nm, x0 + n h}, {nm, {\"t10\", \"t11\", \"t20\", \"t21\", \"t22\", \"R\"}}, {n, -1, 4}], 1], Flatten[Table[{{\"P\", a, r}, x0 + n h}, {a, 2}, {r, 0, 3}, {n, -1, 4}], 2]];\n   starts = Table[{p[[1]], Fold[B[\"act\"][#2[[1]], #2[[2]]][#1] &, B[\"vac\"], p[[1]]]}, {p, sc[\"one-body products\"]}];\n   Flatten[Table[With[{w3 = B[\"act\"][n3[[1]], n3[[2]]][s[[2]]]}, If[oneBodyR[B, w3], {({#[[1]], (#[[2]] - x0)/h} & /@ Append[s[[1]], n3]), reachR[B, w3]}, Nothing]], {s, starts}, {n3, names}], 1]];\nAbsoluteTiming[trip310 = deeperList[B310, sc310];][[1]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"62\" data-out-n=\"382\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"85\" data-sub-start=\"5\" data-sub-end=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[382]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"33\" data-latex-b64=\"MzcuOTUyNzc5\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37.952779</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
