  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: wider pool (point 1, companion frame, generic $r=(2/5,-3/7,5/3)$, exact)\n\nThe pool is fused $t_{10},t_{11},t_{20},t_{21},t_{22}$, $R=t_{20}t_{10}^{-1}$ and the companion pieces $P_{a,r}$, all at $\\theta_1+nh$, $n=-1..4$. We took the one-body singles, the one-body products $O_1O_2$, and the scan's $P$-bilinears.\n\n| rep | one-body singles | union of irreps reached | previously missed irreps |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| $[2,1,0]^2$ (control) | 6 | all 6 | singlet $[2,2,2]$ reached |\n| $[3,1,0]^2$, singles + pairs | $t_{11},t_{21},P_{2,r}$ at $\\theta_1$ | all but $[3,3,2],[4,4,0]$ | $[4,2,2]$ reached |\n| $[3,1,0]^2$, triples | 7 one-body triples | **all** | $[3,3,2]$ and $[4,4,0]$ reached |\n| $[3,2,0]^2$ | $t_{11},t_{22},P_{2,r}$ at $\\theta_1$ | **all** | $[4,3,3]$ reached |\n\n- $[3,2,0]^2$: $[4,3,3]$ is reached by the one-body product $t_{22}(\\theta_1)\\,t_{10}(\\theta_1+2h)$, built from full fused transfer matrices.\n- $[3,1,0]^2$: all 7 one-body triples have the form $P_{2,r}(\\theta_1)\\,P_{1,s}(\\theta_1+h)\\,P_{1,s}(\\theta_1+2h)$, and each reaches both $[3,3,2]$ and $[4,4,0]$.\n  - These are companion pieces, not full twisted transfer matrices.\n  - No triple of full $t$'s or $R$'s stays one-body.\n- Caveats:\n  - One-body and reach were tested at one generic $r$ and one point only.\n  - Reach means a nonzero overlap with the irrep's isotypic component, tested with one generic group element $k$.\n  - For multiplicity-2 irreps a single covector gives rank $\\le1$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# $[4,2,0]^{\\otimes2}$ (dim 729): covector-action version of the pipeline\n\nSame operator pool and tests as above. Every operator acts on the covector through sparse monodromy entries: $w\\mapsto w\\,T_{ij}(x)$, chained, with $t_{10}^{-1}$ via sparse LinearSolve. Validated first on $[3,1,0]$ against `sc310`. Targets are the irreps the earlier families missed, $[6,3,3]$, $[5,4,3]^{\\times2}$ and $[4,4,4]$, together with everything else.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "buildRepV[rep_, rNum_, nRange_] := Module[{d, E, Ls, Tu, TGv, qmAct, taAct, Gc0 = {{4, 11, -30}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}}, h = 1/3, th = {2/7, -5/11}, lw, g, vg0, EEr, wts, hws, hwGroups, kmat, Pik, Gchi, act, t10mat, x0},\n   d = dim[rep]; E[i_, j_] := E[i, j] = SparseArray[JJ[i, j, rep]];\n   Ls[i_, j_][u_] := u IdentityMatrix[d, SparseArray] KroneckerDelta[i, j] - h E[j, i];\n   Tu[{i_, j_}][u_] := Tu[{i, j}][u] = Sum[KroneckerProduct[Ls[i, k][u - th[[1]]], Ls[k, j][u - th[[2]]]], {k, 3}];\n   TGv[Gm_][{i_, j_}][u_] := TGv[Gm][{i, j}][u] = Sum[Tu[{i, k}][u] Gm[[k, j]], {k, 3}];\n   (* w . qminor_{I,I}(u), k-th factor at u + h - k h *)\n   qmAct[Gm_][Ii_, u_][w_] := Sum[Signature[p] Fold[#1 . TGv[Gm][{p[[#2]], Ii[[#2]]}][u + h - #2 h] &, w, Range[Length[Ii]]], {p, Permutations[Ii]}];\n   taAct[Gm_][a_, u_][w_] := Sum[qmAct[Gm][Ii, u][w], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\n   Gchi[c_] := {c, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\n   t10mat[x_] := t10mat[x] = Sum[TGv[Gc0][{i, i}][x], {i, 3}];\n   act[\"t10\", x_][w_] := taAct[Gc0][1, x][w];\n   act[\"t11\", x_][w_] := taAct[Gc0][2, x][w];\n   act[\"t20\", x_][w_] := taAct[Gc0][1, x + h][taAct[Gc0][1, x][w]] - taAct[Gc0][2, x + h][w];\n   act[\"t21\", x_][w_] := taAct[Gc0][1, x + h][taAct[Gc0][2, x][w]] - taAct[Gc0][3, x + h][w];\n   act[\"t22\", x_][w_] := taAct[Gc0][2, x + h][taAct[Gc0][2, x][w]] - taAct[Gc0][1, x][taAct[Gc0][3, x + h][w]];\n   act[\"R\", x_][w_] := Quiet@Check[LinearSolve[Transpose[t10mat[x]], act[\"t20\", x][w]], $Failed];\n   act[{\"P\", a_, 0}, x_][w_] := taAct[Gchi[{0, 0, 0}]][a, x][w];\n   act[{\"P\", a_, r_}, x_][w_] := taAct[Gchi[UnitVector[3, r]]][a, x][w] - taAct[Gchi[{0, 0, 0}]][a, x][w];\n   lw = UnitVector[d, d];\n   g = MatrixExp[r1 Normal[E[2, 1]]] . MatrixExp[r2 Normal[E[3, 1]]] . MatrixExp[r3 Normal[E[3, 2]]] /. rNum;\n   vg0 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[lw . g, lw . g]];\n   EEr[i_, j_] := KroneckerProduct[E[i, j], IdentityMatrix[d, SparseArray]] + KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[d, SparseArray], E[i, j]];\n   wts = Transpose[Diagonal /@ Table[Normal[EEr[i, i]], {i, 3}]];\n   hws = NullSpace[Join[EEr[1, 2], EEr[2, 3]]];\n   hwGroups = GatherBy[hws, wts[[First@FirstPosition[#, x_ /; x != 0]]] &];\n   kmat = MatrixExp[Normal[2/3 E[2, 1] - 1/2 E[3, 1] + 3/5 E[3, 2]]] . MatrixExp[Normal[-1/4 E[1, 2] + 2/7 E[1, 3] + 1/3 E[2, 3]]];\n   Pik = KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[kmat], SparseArray[kmat]];\n   x0 = th[[1]];\n   <|\"d\" -> d, \"act\" -> act, \"vac\" -> vg0, \"lwg\" -> lw . g, \"th1\" -> x0, \"h\" -> h,\n     \"names\" -> Join[Flatten[Table[{nm, x0 + n h}, {nm, {\"t10\", \"t11\", \"t20\", \"t21\", \"t22\", \"R\"}}, {n, nRange}], 1], Flatten[Table[{{\"P\", a, r}, x0 + n h}, {a, 2}, {r, 0, 3}, {n, nRange}], 2]],\n     \"hwImg\" -> Table[{wts[[First@FirstPosition[grp[[1]], x_ /; x != 0]]], (Pik . #) & /@ grp}, {grp, hwGroups}]|>];\n(* scan with singles, pairs (first factor one-body), and optionally triples *)\nscanRepV[B_, depth_] := Module[{singles, sOK, level, all, next},\n   singles = Table[{{nm}, B[\"act\"][nm[[1]], nm[[2]]][B[\"vac\"]]}, {nm, B[\"names\"]}];\n   sOK = Select[singles, oneBodyR[B, #[[2]]] &];\n   all = sOK; level = sOK;\n   Do[next = Flatten[Table[With[{w = B[\"act\"][nm[[1]], nm[[2]]][s[[2]]]}, If[oneBodyR[B, w], {Append[s[[1]], nm], w}, Nothing]], {s, level}, {nm, B[\"names\"]}], 1];\n    all = Join[all, next]; level = next, {depth - 1}];\n   <|\"ops\" -> ({({#[[1]], (#[[2]] - B[\"th1\"])/B[\"h\"]} & /@ #[[1]]), reachR[B, #[[2]]]} & /@ all), \"union reach\" -> Union[Flatten[reachR[B, #[[2]]] & /@ all, 1]], \"all irreps\" -> B[\"hwImg\"][[All, 1]]|>];\n(* validation on [3,1,0], depth 3, same n-range as before *)\nAbsoluteTiming[BV310 = buildRepV[{3, 1, 0}, rGen, Range[-1, 4]]; scV310 = scanRepV[BV310, 3];][[1]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"63\" data-out-n=\"385\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"88\" data-sub-start=\"40\" data-sub-end=\"40\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[385]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"33\" data-latex-b64=\"NTMuOTg2Mzc4\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">53.986378</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
