  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: $[4,2,0]^{\\otimes2}$, depth 2 (point 1, generic $r$, exact; 573 s)\n\nThe covector-action pipeline was validated on $[3,1,0]$ first: depth 3 gives 25 one-body operators and the same union as before.\n\n$[4,2,0]^2$ irreps: $[4,4,4],[5,4,3]^{\\times2},[5,5,2],[6,3,3],[6,4,2],[6,5,1],[6,6,0],[7,3,2],[7,4,1],[7,5,0],[8,2,2],[8,3,1],[8,4,0]$ (multiplicities from the hw count). $[4,2,0]$ is self-dual up to $\\det$, so $[4,4,4]=\\det^4$ plays the role of the singlet.\n\n- One-body singles: $t_{11}(\\theta_1)$, $t_{22}(\\theta_1)$, $P_{2,r}(\\theta_1)$ — the same set as for $[3,2,0]$.\n- One-body pairs: $t_{22}(\\theta_1)t_{10}(\\theta_1+2h)$, and $P_{2,r}(\\theta_1)P_{2,s}(\\theta_1+h)$. There are 16 one-body operators in total.\n- **Previously missed and now reached:** $[6,3,3]$ and $[5,4,3]$, both only via $t_{22}(\\theta_1)\\,t_{10}(\\theta_1+2h)$.\n- **Still missed at depth 2:** $[4,4,4]$ (the singlet analog) and $[6,6,0]$. For $[3,1,0]$ the corresponding gap was closed only at depth 3. Depth 3 here was not run: it would take about 15 min.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* depth 3 for [4,2,0]: extend the one-body pairs of scV420 by one more operator *)\nextendV[B_, sc_] := Module[{x0 = B[\"th1\"], h = B[\"h\"], pairs, starts},\n   pairs = Select[sc[\"ops\"], Length[#[[1]]] == 2 &][[All, 1]];\n   starts = Table[{p, Fold[B[\"act\"][#2[[1]], x0 + #2[[2]] h][#1] &, B[\"vac\"], p]}, {p, pairs}];\n   Flatten[Table[With[{w = B[\"act\"][nm[[1]], nm[[2]]][s[[2]]]}, If[oneBodyR[B, w], {Append[s[[1]], {nm[[1]], (nm[[2]] - x0)/h}], reachR[B, w]}, Nothing]], {s, starts}, {nm, B[\"names\"]}], 1]];\nAbsoluteTiming[trip420 = extendV[BV420, scV420];][[1]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"66\" data-out-n=\"389\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"92\" data-sub-start=\"5\" data-sub-end=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[389]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"33\" data-latex-b64=\"NzAyLjg1MzYxMQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">702.853611</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[389]= 702.853611",
       "mime": "text/plain"
