     ],
     "id": "5b582cdd-d6ed-4269-827c-aef58ca8f379"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: $[4,2,0]^{\\otimes2}$, depth 3 (point 1, generic $r$, exact)\n\nWe extended each of the 10 one-body pairs by one more operator from the pool.\n- 27 triples are one-body. All have the form $P_{2,r}(\\theta_1)\\,P_{2,s}(\\theta_1+h)\\,P_{1,q}(\\theta_1+2h)$.\n- No triple built on $t_{22}(\\theta_1)t_{10}(\\theta_1+2h)$ stays one-body.\n- Their reach is contained in what depth 2 already gave.\n- **$[4,4,4]$ (the singlet analog) and $[6,6,0]$ are still missed.**\n\nCompare $[3,1,0]$, where the $P_2P_1P_1$ triples closed the gap.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Saved data\n\nThe key results of this notebook are written to `transfer-algebra-dim-results.m` (plain Wolfram expressions, same folder). Reload with `res = Get[\"transfer-algebra-dim-results.m\"]`. Point 1 unless stated: $h=1/3$, $\\theta=(2/7,-5/11)$, $z=(2,-3,5)$, companion $\\chi=(4,11,-30)$. Generic rotation $r=(2/5,-3/7,5/3)$. Keys:\n- `siteRotationSoV`: RV coefficients of $(e_8^Tg)\\otimes e_8^T$ at points 1 and 2.\n- `nx`: raw-to-RV normalisations at points 1 and 2.\n- `P1P2`, `twistW`: singlet polynomials and the twist-$w$ reference rotation.\n- `vComponents`: $v=ag^{-1}$ (companion) and $v\\Pi(P)$ (diagonal), symbolic in $r$.\n- `reps`: one-body operators and the irreps they reach, for $[2,1,0],[3,1,0],[3,2,0],[4,2,0]$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* collect results; operator names use points (x - th1)/h *)\nopsList[sc_] := sc[\"ops\"];\nlegacyOps[B_, sc_] := Join[({{nmFmt[B, #[[1]]]}, #[[2]]} & /@ sc[\"one-body singles\"]), ({List @@ nmFmt[B, #[[1]]], #[[2]]} & /@ sc[\"one-body products\"]), ({{#[[1, 1]]}, #[[2]]} & /@ sc[\"one-body bilinears\"])];\nresultsTAD = <|\n   \"conventions\" -> <|\"point1\" -> <|\"h\" -> 1/3, \"theta\" -> {2/7, -5/11}, \"z\" -> {2, -3, 5}, \"chi\" -> {4, 11, -30}|>, \"point2\" -> <|\"h\" -> 1/2, \"theta\" -> {3/13, -4/17}, \"z\" -> {3, -7/2, 11/4}|>, \"rGeneric\" -> rGen,\n     \"rotation\" -> \"g = exp(r1 E21) exp(r2 E31) exp(r3 E32), vacuum (lw^T g) (x) (lw^T g), companion frame\"|>,\n   \"siteRotationSoV\" -> <|\"formula\" -> Normal[guessRV[T]] /. {{\"211\", \"100\"} -> _} -> Nothing, \"formula211_100\" -> ((T - 3) r1 r2 - 2 (T - 2) r3 (r2 - r1 r3))/(T - 1), \"point1\" -> Normal[cRV1], \"point2\" -> Normal[cRV2]|>,\n   \"nx\" -> <|\"point1\" -> Normal[nx1], \"point2\" -> Normal[nx2]|>,\n   \"P1P2\" -> <|\"P1\" -> P1s, \"P2\" -> P2s, \"chiSymbols\" -> {c1, c2, c3}, \"RT11singlet\" -> \"const P1 P2\", \"Rsinglet\" -> \"const P1^2\", \"RlocalizesIff\" -> \"P1 = 0\"|>,\n   \"twistW\" -> <|\"rOfW\" -> rOfW, \"P1\" -> P1w, \"P2\" -> P2w, \"intertwiner\" -> \"Pi(g) t_G Pi(g)^-1 = t_{g G g^-1}, standard units\", \"vacuumEigenFor\" -> \"upper-triangular twist\"|>,\n   \"vComponents\" -> <|\"companion\" -> vC, \"diagonal\" -> vD, \"site2Diagonal\" -> e8D, \"toE1\" -> <|\"h\" -> \"P^-1 w0\", \"newTwist\" -> Gnew, \"v\" -> vN|>|>,\n   \"reps\" -> <|\"[2,1,0]\" -> <|\"irreps\" -> scAdj[\"all irreps\"], \"ops\" -> legacyOps[Badj, scAdj]|>,\n     \"[3,1,0]\" -> <|\"irreps\" -> scV310[\"all irreps\"], \"ops\" -> opsList[scV310]|>,\n     \"[3,2,0]\" -> <|\"irreps\" -> sc320[\"all irreps\"], \"ops\" -> legacyOps[B320, sc320]|>,\n     \"[4,2,0]\" -> <|\"irreps\" -> scV420[\"all irreps\"], \"ops\" -> Join[opsList[scV420], trip420]|>|>|>;\nresFile = FileNameJoin[{\"/home/paul/git_projects/gaudin-CG/Paul/Mathematica/XXX-CG/Building-SoV-bases\", \"transfer-algebra-dim-results.m\"}];\nPut[resultsTAD, resFile];\n(* round-trip check *)\n{FileByteCount[resFile], Get[resFile] === resultsTAD, Keys[resultsTAD]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790499\" data-output-id=\"67\" data-out-n=\"395\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"95\" data-sub-start=\"18\" data-sub-end=\"18\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[395]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"33\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FsaWduZWR9CiAgJlxsZWZ0XHsyNzAwMCxcbWF0aHJte1RydWV9IFxyaWdodC4gXFwKICAmXGxlZnQuICxcbGVmdFx7XHRleHR7Y29udmVudGlvbnN9LFx0ZXh0e3NpdGVSb3RhdGlvblNvVn0sXHRleHR7bnh9LFx0ZXh0e1AxUDJ9LFx0ZXh0e3R3aXN0V30sXHRleHR7dkNvbXBvbmVudHN9LFx0ZXh0e3JlcHN9XHJpZ2h0XH1ccmlnaHRcfQpcZW5ke2FsaWduZWR9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">27000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">conventions</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">siteRotationSoV</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nx</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P1P2</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">twistW</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vComponents</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reps</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[395]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{27000,\\mathrm{True} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\left\\{\\text{conventions},\\text{siteRotationSoV},\\text{nx},\\text{P1P2},\\text{twistW},\\text{vComponents},\\text{reps}\\right\\}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
